  <title>Testing Stuff Out Page</title>
  
<p>Trying to embed some applets and other things to see how they work.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Embedding an R shiny applet that's hosted on a public website. Worked! Need to test how to do this if I build the shiny app myself...</li>
  <li>StatKey embed worked! I can use the applet as is, and I can edit the data. But I can't seem to upload new data sets. 
    It seems like the upload does work, but then I can't actually access it. I try to select columns to use and nothing happens. </li>
  <li>ISI embed worked! You CAN both edit the data box and upload new data. Yay!</li>
  <li> Bottom of Page ~ Embedding working(?) code cell for R .</li>
</ul>

